@startuml
title OpenStack - Infraestructura de red con nodos y WordPress

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

cloud "Internet\n203.0.113.0/24" as INTERNET

node "Controller\nserverocontroller\n203.0.113.239" as CTRL {
  rectangle "enp1s0\nPublic/API" as ENP1
  rectangle "br-mgmt\n10.0.0.11/24" as BRMGMT

  frame "Open vSwitch" as OVS {
    rectangle "br-provider" as BRPROV
    rectangle "br-int" as BRINT
    rectangle "br-tun" as BRTUN
  }

  frame "Neutron" as NEU {
    rectangle "L3 agent\nqrouter-*" as QROUTER
    rectangle "DHCP agent\nqdhcp-*" as QDHCP
  }

  rectangle "NAT/DNAT host\n:8080 -> WordPress" as DNAT
}

node "compute1\n203.0.113.240" as C1
node "compute2\n203.0.113.241" as C2
node "compute3\n203.0.113.242" as C3
node "compute4\n203.0.113.243" as C4

node "storage1\n203.0.113.244\nCeph + Cinder" as ST1
node "object1\n203.0.113.245\nSwift" as O1
node "object2\n203.0.113.246\nSwift" as O2

cloud "Red de gestión/túneles\n10.0.0.0/24" as MGMT
cloud "Red tenant\nselfservice 10.10.10.0/24" as TENANT

node "wp-web-01\n10.10.10.76\nNginx/PHP" as WPWEB
node "wp-db-01\n10.10.10.152\nMariaDB" as WPDB

INTERNET --> ENP1 : Acceso API/Horizon
INTERNET --> DNAT : HTTP :8080
DNAT --> QROUTER : DNAT
QROUTER --> WPWEB : tráfico web
WPWEB --> WPDB : MySQL/MariaDB

BRMGMT -- MGMT
MGMT -- C1
MGMT -- C2
MGMT -- C3
MGMT -- C4
MGMT -- ST1
MGMT -- O1
MGMT -- O2

BRINT <--> QROUTER
BRINT <--> QDHCP
BRINT <--> BRTUN
BRINT <--> BRPROV

BRTUN <--> C1 : VXLAN/Geneve overlays
BRTUN <--> C2 : VXLAN/Geneve overlays
BRTUN <--> C3 : VXLAN/Geneve overlays
BRTUN <--> C4 : VXLAN/Geneve overlays

QROUTER -- TENANT
TENANT -- WPWEB
TENANT -- WPDB

ST1 ..> CTRL : Cinder backend (RBD)
O1 ..> CTRL : Swift object service
O2 ..> CTRL : Swift object service

note right of CTRL
Servicios de red en controller:
- neutron-openvswitch-agent
- neutron-l3-agent
- neutron-dhcp-agent
- openvswitch-switch
(endpoints y agentes en UP)
end note

@enduml
